\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Everlasting Father and Priest\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who came as a lamb for us,
\par turn my heart to be an offe ring
\par for my life time on this earth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Nothing ever can man's love do
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 unless through the love of Christ;
\par whatever man can ever have
\par shall n'er be grateful to God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Take away all my sinful acts
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and all of my foolish thoughts;
\par cleanse all filth and guilt from my heart
\par that will lead me not to sin.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Take me a sacrificial thing
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 as an offering for your own,
\par  Take me now and all that I love
\par  leave out not any of these.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  And then it all shall come to pass
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That surely God will provide,
\par and shall be pleased with my offering
\par on this earth now evermore.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

